Hi all,

I'm trying to install Xenomai-2.5.3 with Linux 2.6.31.12 on my PC (Pentium M
Dell Latitude 810).
First, I have disabled ACPI Processor.
When I run the test examples/native/trivial-periodic.c. => OK
When I stress with : "stress --cpu 1 --io 4 --vm 2 --vm-bytes 128M --timeout
10s" => I have 1.25s between each rt_task_wait_period(NULL);

Then , I have enabled ACPI Processor (Here is my .config).
Kernel arg : idle=poll
When I run the test examples/native/trivial-periodic.c. => I'm not sure but
it seems that each time fans run the time between each wait is 1.25s.

What could I be doing wrong here? please help.

Regards,

